    },
    {
      "displayText": "Le type Normal est le plus fort de tous !!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C0065002000740079007000650020004E006F0072006D0061006C00200065007300740020006C006500200070006C0075007300200066006F0072007400200064006500200074006F00750073002000210021002100100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Déjà, il n’a presque aucune faiblesse !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004400E9006A00E0002C00200069006C0020006E201900610020007000720065007300710075006500200061007500630075006E006500200066006100690062006C00650073007300650020002100100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cela signifie que les Pokémon de ce type peuvent\naffronter n’importe quel adversaire sans crainte !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai beaucoup voyagé et combattu dans ma vie,\ndonc je sais de quoi je parle.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Accepte de te battre contre moi, et je te prouverai\nla supériorité des Pokémon de type Normal !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Viens me voir si ça t’intéresse.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005600690065006E00730020006D006500200076006F00690072002000730069002000E700610020007420190069006E007400E900720065007300730065002E00100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bats-toi contre moi et je te prouverai la supériorité\ndes Pokémon de type Normal. Tu es prêt<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oui !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00750069002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pas encore.",
